  a_ddr5_module_refuses_against_the_ddr4_platform,
  one_incompatible_module_refuses_the_whole_offer,
  an_existing_128gib_host_reports_what_it_provides_and_its_shortfall,
  the_admission_fold_and_the_observation_disagree_on_reachable_bounds,
  an_exactly_sized_machine_is_evenly_bound,
  observation_refuses_a_mismatched_architecture_too,
  the_documented_four_module_shape_is_declined_not_invalid,
  the_permissive_policy_admits_the_documented_partial_shapes,
  a_board_without_a_cited_population_table_refuses_the_permissive_policy,
  the_same_uncited_board_derives_under_the_full_channel_policy,
  three_boards_are_answered_and_every_channel_count_is_derived,
  a_2dpc_board_reaches_a_target_the_1dpc_board_cannot,
  github_x64_is_unreadable_rather_than_contradicting,
  every_declared_sku_is_supported_and_still_carries_its_contradictions,
  a_declared_decimal_basis_converts_to_bytes,
  the_same_quoted_figure_differs_under_a_binary_basis,
  an_undeclared_basis_refuses_the_capacity_derivation,
  an_unstated_entitlement_refuses_rather_than_assuming_cores,
  an_unstated_entitlement_refuses_through_the_fold,
  no_offered_modules_refuses_distinctly,
  a_mixed_capacity_population_is_refused,
  the_fan_out_answers_once_per_sku_and_refuses_the_x64_one,
